  <item>
    <title>人生不过就是三万天飘来荡去的flag呀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676c322315a5fd520e972c52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676c322315a5fd520e972c52</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 21:41:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9c5fd73bba763848f1b84" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9c5fd73bba763848f1b84"><span>刻板印象</span></a><span>的一期串台节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和Erica虽然是同龄人，但我认为她比我勇敢，真的敢于尝试逆社会时钟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>初识，她还在上海，这次录制她已在大洋彼岸的加拿大读书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期年终总结，更是有关个人成长和自我的探索，当在面对不确定性和挑战时，我们也在寻找个人价值的方法，以及如何在快速变化的互联网时代保持自我的策略。（</span><strong><span>好官方啊,下次不用AI了</span></strong><span>）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>真想打劫你们来年的flag啊！插满我的小播客！</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a>-2024年最重要的决定：漂洋过海去干什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a>-时差下的一年居然都变成十二个块状时间</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a>-请收下来自中国的夸赞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> -或许人只有相对的自由，允许万物穿过自己的身体</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a>-时间不仅改变对方，谁都逃不开被打磨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a>-人生啊！到底什么最珍贵？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1914">31:54</a>-人生就是孤独等级KPI</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a>-有机会试试一边听《北极光》一边看极光</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a>-2024有什么是质的飞跃？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a>-有家人的支持才能重新养一遍自己</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3055">50:55</a>-人生嘛，飘来又荡去，就不再立flag了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3283">54:43</a>-真的是“落后时代”吗？或许只是不想那么快“brain rot”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a>-努力做一个普通人或许才是人生常态</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3999">66:39</a>-遇事多想想：人生不过三万天呀，朋友们</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnNF_SKLbGqbMldHGqral7SBC-pl.m4a" length="136612351" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FonSHAOUvtfYUPYa-554AN3Rmyr7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>除了《素食者》，这些对我们来说也是“好东西”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675984e1bdb9877a971e79cd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675984e1bdb9877a971e79cd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 12:35:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年马上就要过去了，可喜可贺的是今年我们看到了很多优秀的女性作品，但这些女性除了收获喜悦同时也要承受更多审视和谩骂，面对这种境况，我们都倍感无奈。</span><strong><span>于是，我们决定再向大家推荐一些有关女性的作品。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期除了邵艺辉的电影《好东西》和韩江的小说《素食者》，我们还会分享另外几位韩国女性的作品以及其他书籍影视作品。</span><em><strong><span>也欢迎大家留言评论你们的年度好东西分享啊！任何你喜欢的好东西都请分享给我们。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>以下是</span><strong><span>罐头</span></strong><span>在得知韩江获得2024年诺贝尔文学奖后发的朋友圈摘录：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>韩江的作品是那种</span><strong><span>不忍再看第二次</span></strong><span>的类型。并不是说韩江写得不好，恰恰相反她写得太好了，她写女人的痛苦写得太过抽象，东亚的女子群像仿佛浓缩成一个平静的女人。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>她是所有女人的代表身份，她会选择坐在窗边看着外面那棵树，想象无限延伸的力量，这种强大的念力是千千万万东亚女性所凝聚的共识:</span><strong><span>自由和自我</span></strong><span>。但太难了，韩江知道。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>所以她把笔头对向男人</span></strong><span>，她写男人自认为的爱、甜蜜和信任，又写得太过具体，具体到你能感受到男人亦真亦假的包装，你知道这份爱的甜蜜是他点给自己的单人餐，他不能，也不想匀出来一点，</span><strong><span>他要的不是爱，是习惯，</span></strong><span>时间一到，他会拿起刀，或手起刀落，或慢慢据开，他不是教会你拿刀叉品尝美味，而是你就是那份美味，儿媳妇、孩子的母亲、家务的承担者…</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>女人知道男人的包装出来的蜜已经开始爬满绿毛，在男人眼里，绿毛不过是婚姻的斑点，你扔不掉就忍着，他遮住你的眼，让你把发毛的绿当叶子，当希望，当承诺。女人开始当真，以为终极谜底就是忍耐与等待，于是她不再仰望窗外。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>东亚女人，尤其是上一辈的女人，就是这么忍，这么等。忍着等着，一辈子就冷冰冰地过下去。</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>韩江一直把绝望的女人跟树挂钩，除了向往生命力之外，可能还在提出一个近几年来的热潮命题:</span><strong><span>东亚女子究竟有没有家？</span></strong><span> 成为一棵树，或许是她们最终的归宿。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>没办法从韩江的文得到解脱。</span><strong><span>没办法解脱。</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>罐头公众号分享：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/M3cbLpo-fc4uewhrCd5LRw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/M3cbLpo-fc4uewhrCd5LRw"><em><strong><span>恨不得向全世界安利《好东西》</span></strong></em></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>内容正文从<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 开始</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 《好东西》观感：我们都钟爱谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> &nbsp;读韩江的作品要做好“心脏在胸腔外裸奔的”心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> &nbsp;为什么要成为一棵树一株植物？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 《素食者》独特的三段式结构 ：第一篇章不仅仅是妻子对丈夫冷漠的对抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a> &nbsp;不论是谁，都有可能被强迫改变习惯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> &nbsp;三段式之第二篇章： 不论女性还是男性都需要对抗的突破口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">23:47</a> &nbsp;第三章：我们生为人的悲哀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> &nbsp;八零后崔恩荣笔下的离别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> &nbsp;金爱烂为何被比喻为“韩国的张爱玲”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> &nbsp;韩国作品近两年都是以女性为主体，辐射到每个个体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> &nbsp;韩国作家笔下的“弑父情节”和“牛马”以及“因果报应”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> &nbsp;罐头《如何成为不完美主义者》的flag立住了吗？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>提到的电影：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35633904/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35633904/"><span>刺猬</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36587974/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36587974/"><span>出走的决心</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/33439913/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/33439913/"><span>新封神之哪吒闹海</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/37066621/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/37066621/"><span>凤凰：她的传奇</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36934908/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36934908/"><span>因果报应</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>提到的书籍：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36438780/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36438780/"><span>失语者</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36457094/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36457094/"><span>明亮的夜晚</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36489654/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36489654/"><span>对我无害之人</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36467141/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36467141/"><span>即使不努力</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36109193/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36109193/"><span>外面是夏天</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36327195/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36327195/"><span>九号的工作</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《角质层》▪金爱灿</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36109148/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36109148/"><span>滔滔生活</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36062802/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36062802/"><span>诅咒兔</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36238843/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36238843/"><span>他人</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36327195/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36327195/"><span>九号的工作</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36496555/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36496555/"><span>爱，鸡尾酒与生化危机</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>提到的作者：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/35140959/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/35140959/"><span>崔恩荣</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/30095437/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/30095437/"><span>韩江</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/35081396/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/35081396/"><span>金爱烂</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/36115428/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/36115428/"><span>郑宝拉</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/36136003/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/36136003/"><span>金惠珍</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/36865399/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/36865399/"><span>赵艺恩</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>相关链接：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67052a5f81cdab3a938c73cb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67052a5f81cdab3a938c73cb"><span>《如何成为不完美主义者》| 先试着哄好自己再说吧？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DbXMtpqHXZ1Hqe5SfQUOIw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DbXMtpqHXZ1Hqe5SfQUOIw"><span>2023，i人的年度书单推荐</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6742f8828d1233fb0d99abfd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6742f8828d1233fb0d99abfd"><span>《冷到下雪》|也许不去理解万事万物也没关系</span></a></p>]]></description>
