  <item>
    <title>《冷到下雪》|也许不去理解万事万物也没关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6742f8828d1233fb0d99abfd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6742f8828d1233fb0d99abfd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Nov 2024 10:14:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjqancFMjotBRzMu9O5Mz2BaIKCT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小说</span><strong><span>《冷到下雪》</span></strong><span>以十月东京的雨天为背景，讲述了一对母女共同旅行的故事。作者欧健梅，澳大利亚华裔小说家，外祖父从中国移民到马来西亚，母亲则从马来西亚移居澳大利亚。在她的成长经历里，中国、马来西亚和澳大利亚都是她的家乡，但与此同时又都不是。而这种复杂的</span><strong><span>移民背景</span></strong><span>深刻地影响了她的创作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小说中母亲在香港长大，在两个女儿出生之前移民。在这次东京的旅行中母女间彬彬有礼亲密而又疏离同时也夹杂着失望与希望。欧健建梅以最纤细的笔触描绘母女之间的互动，各种情绪也在聊天气、聊星座、聊服装乃至家庭、回忆家族以及久远记忆中翻滚涌动。故事情节也在过去与当下，现实与虚幻中不断闪现。小说与其说在描写“东亚母女关系”，不如说想映射出人与人在理解沟通上的困境，</span><em><span>也许不去理解万事万物也没关系。</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目将参与到今年播客年度书单计划当中。播客年度书单是由播客公社发起的公共计划，旨在通过播客向大众宣传当年出版的优质图书。完整书单将在年底正式公布。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期时点：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> &nbsp;本期节目将参与到今年播客年度书单计划当中</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;书评为什么褒贬不一？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> &nbsp;当东亚母女关系笼罩在移民文化中，书写方式也不再具有刻板印象</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> “亲密与疏离”在书中无处不在，移民背景带来的身份不认同</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;对女儿的期待，为何总是如此极端？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> &nbsp;刻意削弱语境下的情感冲突，以一种创新的手法描写母女情感</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> &nbsp;小说中所有情绪流动都需要通过行动描述去揣测</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">28:49</a> &nbsp;小说描写特有方式：如果将本书拍成影视剧会怎样？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;人与人之间的关系都应该具有不同的书写方式</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> &nbsp;书名叫做《冷到下雪》但书中为什么完全没有描写下雪？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> &nbsp;电影《致允熙》中温馨的母女关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> &nbsp;亲密的母女关系关注过多的逃离</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> &nbsp;台剧《影后》中母女线设定：从质疑、到理解直至和解？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提到的书/影视：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhrIuoxP-5HyuhViqXT4JP6HWY6I.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《雨》黄锦树/四川人民出版社/后浪/2018-3出版</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FswIDjNms0JD4rzkSFNTfSKeacsf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《致允熙》韩国/金喜爱 中村优子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl3wCyG3x3bWEnsTwf8CzC_MJHUA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《妈妈朋友的儿子》/韩国/2024</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhFpP_o7yX86yej3Omh3Mt0izue_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《影后》/中国台湾/2024</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本书摘抄：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>仿佛我们一旦分开，这如潮的人流会把我们越推越远，再也无法回到彼此身边。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>有时候，停下来，反思发生过的事也许是件好事，也许回想悲伤往事反而能让你快乐起来。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>但谁又能预测某人在某天进行的某个特定行为呢？更别提在灵魂深处那些隐秘角落，形形色色的行为都是存在的。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>冷眼旁观她错误的认知，力所能及地提供抚慰。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不去了解、不做决定难道不行吗？一切都听任自然，顺从本心，过好当下生活，也许才是更深刻的真理。任何人、任何事我们都掌握不了，就连这点其实我也不敢确定。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>让人精疲力竭的往往不是大变故而是那些数不清的小事情。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>生活里如此细碎的小事，就是幸福的来源。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>父母是孩子的宿命，不仅体现在命运的大悲剧中，也在更细小却依然有影响力的其他方面。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>脑中只有一个模糊而倦怠的想法，也许不去理解万事万物也没关系，只要去看见、去把握就行。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>从某种意义上来说，写作和画画如出一辙。只有通过这种方式，人才能回到过去，改变过去，让事物改头换面，变成我们理想中的样子，或者我们希望看到的样子。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>分享：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>罐头 &nbsp;</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D_4ltcFQnktXsVTV8P_B-w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D_4ltcFQnktXsVTV8P_B-w"><span>上一期播客读书笔记文字版《如何成为不完美主义者》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NjY5NzMxMA==&amp;mid=2247484740&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0d86d69e0997d4661b3403d18b175f58&amp;chksm=e86437532abd90460795ff1d9d863fc92fffb18c1b99b0d223e11a2618371ec03aa7e34251e2&amp;mpshare=1&amp;srcid=1124HzwCVXkbHwBTGyyiUZHj&amp;sharer_shareinfo=53da7fe9ca10a65a52b8b9dde6f3b820&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=53da7fe9ca10a65a52b8b9dde6f3b820&amp;from=timeline&amp;scene=2&amp;subscene=1&amp;sessionid=1732493472&amp;clicktime=1732493530&amp;enterid=1732493530&amp;ascene=2&amp;fasttmpl_type=0&amp;fasttmpl_fullversion=7482634-zh_CN-zip&amp;fasttmpl_flag=0&amp;realreporttime=1732493530662&amp;devicetype=android-31&amp;version=28003636&amp;nettype=WIFI&amp;abtest_cookie=AAACAA%3D%3D&amp;lang=zh_CN&amp;exportkey=n_ChQIAhIQFDE%2BduKuJCzhgiQdmkMfDRLsAQIE97dBBAEAAAAAACqqBDcJAvcAAAAOpnltbLcz9gKNyK89dVj0lza2kNkpi1aR9TQgXM7S0fblp57TBPe3fP2QmDvuvVYBcwYXS5rc09m2pO95fB0GPIniZwveV59aUGrMJGbPVVdA15fVtOB%2FnNjeggj%2FXgecbuV%2BOhIJrRjpM4xTOpdHaXEdsYrrRvFYD7y6StyuckwYFT3m7%2FqLR4YJyQnuUDj%2F1cFzenm1rx1wgJ4Cou9PaP5kN9XJPp53%2FAMpedIAJNBnUX6vq40PGh31QnlOFAyVL4g5j78Qw4EdzupUSe%2FhNeXFQKU%2B&amp;pass_ticket=5ceUMBuFZRLWh09a%2B4c3xvTB%2FwqwybPHL5rw59llMylHLlgRExQEx9wP%2F83E8dnV&amp;wx_header=3" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI0NjY5NzMxMA==&amp;mid=2247484740&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0d86d69e0997d4661b3403d18b175f58&amp;chksm=e86437532abd90460795ff1d9d863fc92fffb18c1b99b0d223e11a2618371ec03aa7e34251e2&amp;mpshare=1&amp;srcid=1124HzwCVXkbHwBTGyyiUZHj&amp;sharer_shareinfo=53da7fe9ca10a65a52b8b9dde6f3b820&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=53da7fe9ca10a65a52b8b9dde6f3b820&amp;from=timeline&amp;scene=2&amp;subscene=1&amp;sessionid=1732493472&amp;clicktime=1732493530&amp;enterid=1732493530&amp;ascene=2&amp;fasttmpl_type=0&amp;fasttmpl_fullversion=7482634-zh_CN-zip&amp;fasttmpl_flag=0&amp;realreporttime=1732493530662&amp;devicetype=android-31&amp;version=28003636&amp;nettype=WIFI&amp;abtest_cookie=AAACAA%3D%3D&amp;lang=zh_CN&amp;exportkey=n_ChQIAhIQFDE%2BduKuJCzhgiQdmkMfDRLsAQIE97dBBAEAAAAAACqqBDcJAvcAAAAOpnltbLcz9gKNyK89dVj0lza2kNkpi1aR9TQgXM7S0fblp57TBPe3fP2QmDvuvVYBcwYXS5rc09m2pO95fB0GPIniZwveV59aUGrMJGbPVVdA15fVtOB%2FnNjeggj%2FXgecbuV%2BOhIJrRjpM4xTOpdHaXEdsYrrRvFYD7y6StyuckwYFT3m7%2FqLR4YJyQnuUDj%2F1cFzenm1rx1wgJ4Cou9PaP5kN9XJPp53%2FAMpedIAJNBnUX6vq40PGh31QnlOFAyVL4g5j78Qw4EdzupUSe%2FhNeXFQKU%2B&amp;pass_ticket=5ceUMBuFZRLWh09a%2B4c3xvTB%2FwqwybPHL5rw59llMylHLlgRExQEx9wP%2F83E8dnV&amp;wx_header=3"><span>《冷到下雪》：理解万事万物，也无法减轻痛苦</span></a></p>]]></description>
