    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>“IE浏览器”恢复能量方式差异有多大？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d8ddc2ee04007d8836cda4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d8ddc2ee04007d8836cda4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 22:22:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>串台嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>Cynthia，</span></em><span>《自观自在》主播</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>罐头 &nbsp;&nbsp;夏夏</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>I人和E人如何恢复能量？</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>人生中大多数事情的发生，是我们无能为力也无法控制更无法干预的，有时或许很小的事都能让我们陷入负面情绪。及时给自己竖起一道安全边界，不要让自己接收干扰的同时，也要及时通过合适自己的方式补充</span><strong><span>【情绪能量】</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a>播客录到破防？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a>毫无意义的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> 职场阴阳和八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a> 不想回复消息怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 对负面情绪的性别偏见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a> 在家不能哭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 为什么拍照一定要笑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 置顶自我感受是自私吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> &nbsp;获得能量清单公布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3165">52:45</a> 我们还需要他人情感陪伴和支持吗？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>你最常用到恢复能量的方式是？</span></strong></em></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li-ZJQVQ-QL0h4rRo765SN8Y8Sl6.m4a" length="117476953" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FonSHAOUvtfYUPYa-554AN3Rmyr7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>勇敢的人先享受N+1，gap第一站先去哪？？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ca02c37ae3d6d8d2dcbd85</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ca02c37ae3d6d8d2dcbd85</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Aug 2024 15:56:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小i，播客</span></strong><span>《生活大别野》主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>前段时间得到公司赔偿离职后，她决定先到离上海不远的安吉数字游民社区感受一下，节目中会分享她作为资深HR的一些职场观点；这两年她通过做公众号和播客获得的资源；以及对自由职业的一些看法，比如她正在做的保险经纪和播客。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最新进展：她现在已再次开始职场人身份，有机会邀请她分享一下近况。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>我们不倡导轻易裸辞，除非有N+1</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>其实没有那么早准备离职，但可能这也正好是契机</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么北京海淀的老师也想换职业赛道？</span></p><span></span><p><span>住在数字游民社区到底都是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span>原来还是有不同的活法和生活，是否可以没有“卷”文化？</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为主理人怎么看播客未来市场发展？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luMQNDR86XFkj24HHj33m8JisVFL.m4a" length="68242297" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FonSHAOUvtfYUPYa-554AN3Rmyr7.png"/>
